'''Exeggutor ex''' (Japanese: '''ナッシーex''' ''Nassy ex'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Stage 1 {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

